    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "7D7A79D5E660C5B4",
      "text": "Una passeggiata!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "7D7A7CD5E660CACD",
      "text": "Un incubo!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "86B5C79CF6026FBC",
      "text": "Forse è stato un gioco da ragazzi perché c’eri tu![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_02b",
      "hash64": "E9520DB60624163A",
      "text": "Immagino! Dev’essere stata un’impresa\\nestenuante.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "86B5C89CF602716F",
      "text": "Siete andati a fare ricerche in una grande\\ncaverna a Paldea, giusto?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "86B5C59CF6026C56",
      "text": "Certo che non è tanto carino farti tornare\\na Paldea nel bel mezzo di un programma\\r\\ndi scambio...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_03",
      "hash64": "7D7A7BD5E660C91A",
      "text": "Cose che capitano",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_select_04",
      "hash64": "7D7A76D5E660C09B",
      "text": "In effetti...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "86B5C69CF6026E09",
      "text": "Sei proprio una persona matura...\\nAl posto tuo, io mi sarei lamentata un bel po’.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "E94EE7B606219FD1",
      "text": "Vero? Non è così che si fa.\\nNon ci siamo per niente![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "86B5C39CF60268F0",
      "text": "Queste cose succedono perché l’istituto\\nsi prende troppe libertà.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "86B5C49CF6026AA3",
      "text": "Dobbiamo sempre far presente quando\\nnon siamo d’accordo su qualcosa![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "584CCB84E90DCCB5",
      "text": "Scusa, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], avresti un momento?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 8,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "584CCA84E90DCB02",
      "text": "Volevo informarti di cosa è successo nel Club\\nLega mentre eri via.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "584CC984E90DC94F",
      "text": "Innanzitutto... per evitare di fare confusione,\\nabbiamo momentaneamente sospeso\\r\\nle variazioni nella classifica della LeMi![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "584CC884E90DC79C",
      "text": "In più, abbiamo aggiunto una regola che sancisce\\nche anche gli studenti dei programmi di scambio\\r\\npossono diventare Campioni![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "584CC784E90DC5E9",
      "text": "Abbiamo anche ripristinato il regolamento\\noriginale, revocando le parti che Riben\\r\\naveva reso più rigide.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "584CC684E90DC436",
      "text": "E molto altro! Ci siamo dati tantissimo da fare![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "0D491132F0304C51",
      "text": "Grazie!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "0D490E32F0304738",
      "text": "Sarà stata una faticaccia",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "584CC584E90DC283",
      "text": "Ah...! Scusa! Con questo non volevo\\ndire che devi ringraziarmi.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "584CC484E90DC0D0",
      "text": "Comunque non preoccuparti, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nD’altronde è una nostra responsabilità...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "584CD384E90DDA4D",
      "text": "Anche se Aris come al solito ha dormito\\nper TUTTA la riunione![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "584CD284E90DD89A",
      "text": "Comunque, queste erano le novità\\nsul Club Lega![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "AFF8958C858C4FC4",
      "text": "Ciao, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Potrei parlarti un attimo?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "AFF8968C858C5177",
      "text": "Quando Riben era Campione, al club c’era\\nun’atmosfera piuttosto pesante...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "AFF8978C858C532A",
      "text": "Questo ha dato fastidio ad alcuni, che hanno\\npreferito uscire dal club.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "AFF8988C858C54DD",
      "text": "Perciò, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ora vorrei che fossi tu\\na decidere i nuovi cardini futuri del Club Lega![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "AFF8918C858C48F8",
      "text": "Hai in mente qualcosa a cui ispirarci?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
